      "title": "Important Loras",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "version": "7.5.2",
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**TURBO LORA**\n\nUse the Raw main model, and always leave the turbo lora on at 1.0 strength.\n\nAlternatively, you can use the Turbo main model and remove the turbo lora.\n\n**2 VECTOR FILTER BYPASS LORA**\n\nSet it to 1.0 strength for most things. Leave it on even when you're using NSFW loras (but don't go higher than 1.0 then).\n\nIt will degrade image quality past 1.0 strength, which is why you usually don't want to go higher.\n\nYou can also use NSFW loras to improve prompt adherence *even for SFW prompts*. Censorship is bad for everyone."
      ],
      "color": "#2a363b",
      "bgcolor": "#3f5159"
    },
